  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowerment of youth and  internally displaced people with focus on women in Cabo Delgado</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this initiative is to enhance food security and socio-economic resilience in Cabo Delgado through agriculture training, support and extension with the engagement of the Ocua (former Bilbiiza) agrarian institutte</narrative>
  </description>
